            "review_title": "Review at My Quang My Son",
            "review_text": "Scienceandreligion\n1 contribution\n0\nOne of the best dishes\nAug 2024 • Friends\nThere are reviews on here talking about how the pork has been \"sitting in the broth for a couple of hours already\", but that is how the soup is made. it takes hours and hours to make the rich savory broth. The different meats are also cooked for a long time to get them to be super tender. if you think they are getting that flavor deep into the meat by just cooking it right before they put it in your soup, then you do not understand how to cook. I would reccommend this dish to anyone that likes a phenomenal soup.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 19, 2024",
